## Requirements

- Rust **1.85+** (MSRV; required for Rust edition 2024)
- `cargo` (ships with Rust)
- Optional tooling (install via `rustup component add` / `cargo install`):
  - `rustfmt` — formatter (`rustup component add rustfmt`)
  - `clippy` — linter and static analyser (`rustup component add clippy`)
  - `cargo-deny` — license / advisory / dependency audit
    (`cargo install --locked cargo-deny`)

